        <body>
            <div xml:id="d538-a3">

                <pb facs="0890" n="754" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg754"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No.
                    973.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Proclamation of Brandeis.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Government of Samoa</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mulinuu</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1888-09-05"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 5,
                    1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">To the chiefs and rulers of Tuamasaga,
                        Manono, and le Faasaleleaga in the bush:</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chiefs</hi>: By authority of His Majesty Tamasese,
                    the King of Samoa, I make known unto you all that The German man-of-war is about
                    to go, together with a Samoan fleet, for the purpose of burning Manono, on
                    account of their seci et actions. After this island Manono is all burnt, ‘tis
                    good, if the people return to Manono and live quiet. If they obey, then no other
                    punishment will come upon them or added to above.</p>
                <p>To the people of le Faasaleleaga I say return to your homes and stop there; the
                    same to those belonging to Tuamasaga.</p>
                <p>If you obey this instruction, then you will all be forgiven. If you do not obey,
                    then all your villages will be burnt down the same as Manono.</p>
                <p>These instructions were made Or set forth in truth. In sight of God in the
                    heaven.</p>
                <p>Chiefs, I am,</p>
                <closer>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal.</hi>] <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Brandeis</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The chief leader of the
                            Government.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
